On Error Goto E
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
For I=1 To 4 : Ink I : Bar 0,0 To 15,15 : Get Bob I,0,0 To 16,16 : Next I : Cls 0
Synchro Off
Bob 1,10,10,1 : Bob 2,100,20,1
Channel 1 To Bob 1 : Channel 2 To Bob 2
Amal 1,"Let X=40; Let Y=30; Move 60,-20,10; Move -15,25,4; Anim 2,(2,2)(3,1)(4,3); Move 10,10,6; Let A=1"
Amal On 1
For I=1 To 26 : Synchro : Print #1,I;X Bob(1);Y Bob(1);I Bob(1);Chanmv(1);Chanan(1) : Next I
Anim 2,"(1,2)(2,2)(3,1)L"
Move X 2,"(1,3,4)(2,-2,3)L"
Move Y 2,"(3,1,5)E40"
Anim On 2 : Move On 2
For I=1 To 30 : Synchro : Print #1,I;X Bob(2);Y Bob(2);I Bob(2);Movon(2);Chanan(2) : Next I
Move Freeze 2 : Synchro : Print #1,X Bob(2);Y Bob(2) : Move On 2 : Synchro : Print #1,X Bob(2);Y Bob(2)
Anim Off : Move Off
Channel 3 To Screen Offset 0 : Amal 3,"Let X=5; Let Y=7; Move 10,10,5"
Amal On 3 : For I=1 To 6 : Synchro : Next I : Wait Vbl : Wait Vbl : Print #1,X Screen(0,0)
Channel 4 To Screen Display 0 : Amal 4,"Let X=150; Let Y=60" : Amal On 4 : Synchro : Synchro
Amal Off
Channel 5 To Sprite 3 : Amal 5,"Let X=200; Let Y=100; Let A=2; Move 8,4,4" : Amal On 5
For I=1 To 5 : Synchro : Print #1,X Sprite(3);Y Sprite(3);I Sprite(3) : Next I
Amal Off : Synchro On
Print #1,"end"
Goto FIN
E: Print #1,"error";Errn : Resume Next
FIN:
